{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】今日是已故武打巨星李小龍86歲冥壽，在尖沙咀星光大道有紀念獻花儀式。</p>\n<p>有市民穿上李小龍經典黃黑戲服鞠躬，獻上花束致意，亦有人用手機拍下銅像，懷緬一代武打巨星。</p>\n<p>儀式於尖沙咀星光大道李小龍銅像前舉行，由李小龍會主席、李小龍胞弟李振輝伉儷主持。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T07:43:53.485862+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T07:24:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T07:57:32.774476+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T07:37:26.192783+00:00","content_hash":"f75eb3ef8cb122b178c731d9cc86c009db79c2c1aea124e67b6b6c31edc86677","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}